1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:07,140
Good morning, and especially good morning to all of my fellow Black women who find me

2
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:12,560
quote-unquote annoying, irritating, loud, etc.

3
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:20,680
This is really something else, and one day you will be revering me, because you will

4
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:26,260
understand that the reasons that you disliked me had nothing to do with me, and everything

5
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:32,400
to do with the fact that you were not willing to do the work on yourself that causes you

6
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:36,740
to hate people like me, who tell you the truth about the world you're in, that you don't

7
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:37,420
want to believe.

8
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:45,040
Every time y'all come in my comments and say mean s*** about me, it breaks my heart a little

9
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:49,620
bit, and then the real ones sew it back together.

10
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:52,080
So good morning to you real ones.

11
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:58,380
May the sun bathe upon you and empower you to fight another day for a world that you

12
00:00:58,380 --> 00:00:59,840
